{"id":"situacio_n","lemma":"situación","pos":"noun","rank":524,"glosses":["situation, scenario, picture","position (based on circumstance or the effect of another's actions)","status, state of affairs, condition"],"ipa":"/sitwaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"situaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-situaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La situación es desagradable.","en":"The situation is ugly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301851"},{"text":"Él está acostumbrado a esta clase de situaciones.","en":"He is used to that type of situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687452"},{"text":"Es una situación fea.","en":"It's an ugly situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461205"},{"text":"Me siento incómodo en esa clase de situaciones.","en":"I feel uncomfortable in this kind of situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1156758"},{"text":"Esta situación es extraña.","en":"This situation is funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67114"}]}